  "stageId": "main_00-07",
  "title": "感染",
  "storyCode": "0-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "325b4d9c867fca53acee12126e6b1c463024fcfd5071063204728ca730704d37",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "依照既定路線，我們已經很接近切城南邊的中城區了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "穿過這個公園，就是會合點。不出意外的話，臨光和E4小隊應該已經在那裡等著我們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "要是臨光......被襲擊了，會怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "要是他們原本想用通訊設施警告我們，卻發現訊號遭到干擾......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "我們該怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們會去確認。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "我們要親眼確認事件之後，才會做出揣測。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "不要用懷疑恐嚇自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "明，明白了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "失去聯絡手段所帶來的恐慌情緒，比想像中蔓延得快得多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "特別是......在這個天災仿佛近在眼前的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "我們得趕緊加快速度了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "欸......這陣霧氣......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "——難道——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "小心！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "幹掉他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "敵軍的射擊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "這是陷阱......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "————！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "不好，我們的後方也出現了整合運動的追兵......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "偵查幹員呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "被戰場分割了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "羅德島......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "追上你們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "殺！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這次，就讓你們粉身碎骨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "杜賓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "狙擊幹員！壓制敵人的衝鋒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "重裝幹員，防禦姿態，隨時準備向前頂上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "Ace，準備————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等一下，等一下——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "在清剿了東南要塞之後，我一聽到你的消息，可是立刻就趕過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這裡已經是我的處理範圍囉，弑君者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弑君者",
      "text": "你來做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "該把他們，交給我了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
